            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(5) Rights of Employee Regarding Insurance Plan, Retirement Plan, etc. While an employee is on the preferred recall list, or if he or she is recalled within such period, or if his or her employment is terminated without recall, the employee's rights under the Group Life Insurance Plan, Retirement Plan, MichCon Traditional Medical Plan or Health Maintenance Insurance Plans, Group Dental Plan, Surviving Spouse Annuity Plan and Prescription Drug Co-Pay Plan shall be governed by the provisions of such plans.",
